The client of the ESPSomfy RTS controllers (src/espsomfy/) was written in
JavaScript for this project, from the source code of the ESPSomfy RTS
firmware (https://github.com/rstrouse/ESPSomfy-RTS) and of its Home
Assistant integration (https://github.com/rstrouse/ESPSomfy-RTS-HA), both by
rstrouse and released into the public domain (The Unlicense): HTTP API,
socket events, shade types, position conventions.

It uses the npm package "ws" (MIT, https://github.com/websockets/ws).

